  "releaseNotes": "v0.3.1 fix(sonar): pass CancellationToken and fix new-code issues (#1938)\n        v0.3.0 feat(onedrive-sync-client): Enter adds category and name textbox keeps focus\n        v0.2.0 feat(onedrive-sync-client): show sync throughput bar graph in the account panel\n        v0.1.5 fix(app-db): emit the Colour root instead of Color\n        v0.1.4 fix(onedrive-sync-client): stop classifying code file names as Person and remove the bad categories\n        v0.1.3 fix(build): pin SDK and analyzer target framework\n        v0.1.2 perf(onedrive-sync-client): skip remote walk when Graph delta shows no relevant changes\n        v0.1.1 fix(release-notes): XML-escape PR title in PackageReleaseNotes and repair broken csproj\n        v0.1.0 fix(infrastructure-app-db): map NULL Option<string> columns to Option.None",
